 --------
 
+The right-hand operand need not be a direct child of the left-hand operand: the constraint is satisfied when the right-hand object is contained at any depth below the left-hand object. For example, an `OBSERVATION` inside a `SECTION` of a Composition satisfies `COMPOSITION c CONTAINS OBSERVATION o`.
+
